      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <p class="name">David S. Jones</p>
      <p>I've spent more than twenty-five years as a consultant in technology and cybersecurity, and more than fifty as a believer in Christ. I'm a member of Scottsdale Bible Church, where I serve on the worship teams and disciple men through the church's ministry, The Forge. Trained in classical music at Northern Arizona University; father of two, Austin and Izzy.</p>
      <p>My heart is for service and for evangelism &mdash; helping ordinary people meet the God whose forgiveness has no limit. That's what this site is: a table set every week, for anyone who wants to sit down.</p>
